<title>UK: Finnish Export Credit sets $90 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Finnish Export Credit sets $90 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Wako International (Europe) Ltd</p>
<p> BORROWER   FINNISH EXPORT CREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    $90 MLN	 COUPON     5.65	MATURITY    20.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    17.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.35	LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K) FIVE</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
